  ('Hangi seçenekteki cümlede ilgi zamiri (relative pronoun) cümleden ÇIKARILABİLİR?', 'The ceramic vase that the apprentice accidentally dropped dated back to the Ming Dynasty.', ['The cardiologist who performed the bypass surgery briefed the patient\'s family at dawn.', 'Lake Baikal, which holds roughly a fifth of the world\'s unfrozen surface freshwater, lies in Siberia.', 'A glacier is a massive body of dense ice that moves slowly under its own immense weight.'], 'Sadece tanımlayıcı (virgülsüz) cümlecikte nesne konumunda bulunan ilgi zamiri çıkarılabilir; \'that the apprentice dropped\' yapısında \'that\' nesnedir.'),
